Privacy Policy

We do not collect, sell, or share personal information about visitors to this website.

Please use discretion when sharing personal details in public chat areas, including your full name, location, workplace, social media accounts, email address, or phone number.

If you choose to exchange personal information, we recommend doing so only through private messages with individuals you know and trust.

You are not required to use your real name or disclose any information you are not comfortable sharing.
